{"seq":3,"slug":"collation-sorting-search","title":"排序规则与搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling/collation-sorting-search","wordCount":1541,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"排序规则与搜索\">排序规则与搜索</h1><p>「按字母顺序排列」在多语言环境中是一个伪命题。德语把 <code>ö</code> 排在 <code>o</code> 之后还是视为 <code>oe</code>？瑞典语把 <code>ä</code> 排在 <code>z</code> 之后。日语有三套字符系统需要交叉排序。后端系统如果用字节序排列多语言文本，结果对用户而言就是乱序的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>UCA 多级权重</strong>：Unicode Collation Algorithm 按 L1(基础字符) → L2(重音) → L3(大小写) → L4(标点) 逐级比较</li>\n<li><strong>Locale Tailoring</strong>：同一字符在不同 locale 的排序位置完全不同（瑞典语 ä 在 z 之后，德语 ä 在 a 之后）</li>\n<li><strong>排序键预计算</strong>：将字符串转为可 memcmp 直接比较的二进制键，amortize 高频排序的成本</li>\n<li><strong>多语言搜索</strong>：分词、词干提取、音译索引需要 per-locale 的分析器配置</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"unicode-collation-algorithm-uca\">Unicode Collation Algorithm (UCA)</h2><p>UCA（Unicode Technical Standard #10）定义了一套与语言无关的基础排序规则（DUCET），再通过 CLDR 的 locale tailoring 为每种语言调整。</p>\n<p>核心机制是<strong>多级比较权重</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>比较内容</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 (Primary)</td>\n<td>基础字符差异</td>\n<td>a vs b</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 (Secondary)</td>\n<td>重音/变音符号差异</td>\n<td>a vs á</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 (Tertiary)</td>\n<td>大小写差异</td>\n<td>a vs A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 (Quaternary)</td>\n<td>标点/特殊变体</td>\n<td>a vs a-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>排序时先比较所有字符的 L1 权重；L1 相同再比 L2；依次递推。这产生了符合语言习惯的排序结果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>compare</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>cmp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>cmp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if L1 equal, </mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>cmp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>L</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{compare}(s_1, s_2) = \\begin{cases}\n\\text{cmp}(L1(s_1), L1(s_2)) &amp; \\text{if } \\neq 0 \\\\\n\\text{cmp}(L2(s_1), L2(s_2)) &amp; \\text{if L1 equal, } \\neq 0 \\\\\n\\text{cmp}(L3(s_1), L3(s_2)) &amp; \\text{otherwise}\n\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">compare</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cmp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cmp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cmp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if L1 equal, </span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">otherwise</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Input: café, Cafe, caff&quot;] --&gt; B[L1 Compare&lt;br/&gt;base characters]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;caf- vs caf- vs caff&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D{L1 distinguishes?}&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;café/Cafe: same L1&quot;| E[L2 Compare&lt;br/&gt;accents]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;caff: different L1 (f&gt;e)&quot;| F[&quot;caff sorted last&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G{L2 distinguishes?}&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;café has accent&quot;| H[&quot;café after Cafe at L2&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;same L2&quot;| I[L3 Compare&lt;br/&gt;case]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Input: café, Cafe, caff\"] --&gt; B[L1 Compare&lt;br/&gt;base characters]\n    B --&gt; C[\"caf- vs caf- vs caff\"]\n    C --&gt; D{L1 distinguishes?}\n    D --&gt;|\"café/Cafe: same L1\"| E[L2 Compare&lt;br/&gt;accents]\n    D --&gt;|\"caff: different L1 (f&gt;e)\"| F[\"caff sorted last\"]\n    E --&gt; G{L2 distinguishes?}\n    G --&gt;|\"café has accent\"| H[\"café after Cafe at L2\"]\n    G --&gt;|\"same L2\"| I[L3 Compare&lt;br/&gt;case]</pre><h2 id=\"locale-特定的排序差异\">Locale 特定的排序差异</h2><p>同一组字符串在不同 locale 下排序结果完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字符串对</th>\n<th>en-US 排序</th>\n<th>de-DE (phonebook)</th>\n<th>sv-SE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ä vs z</td>\n<td>ä &lt; z</td>\n<td>ä &lt; z (ä=ae)</td>\n<td>z &lt; ä</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ö vs p</td>\n<td>ö &lt; p... 不对，ö &gt; o &lt; p</td>\n<td>ö = oe &lt; p</td>\n<td>z &lt; ö</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ß vs ss</td>\n<td>ß = ss</td>\n<td>ß = ss</td>\n<td>ß = ss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ch vs d</td>\n<td>c &lt; d</td>\n<td>c &lt; d</td>\n<td>c &lt; d</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ll vs m</td>\n<td>l &lt; m</td>\n<td>l &lt; m</td>\n<td>l &lt; m</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>瑞典语将 <code>ä</code>, <code>ö</code>, <code>å</code> 排在字母表末尾（z 之后），这与德语/英语完全相反。如果电商网站对瑞典用户用英语 collation 排产品名，以 Ö 开头的品牌会被混排到 O 附近，而非用户期望的末尾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据库-collation-配置\">数据库 Collation 配置</h2><p>关系型数据库的 collation 设置决定了 <code>ORDER BY</code>、<code>WHERE =</code>、<code>LIKE</code>、<code>DISTINCT</code> 的行为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据库</th>\n<th>配置层级</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PostgreSQL 15+</td>\n<td>Database → Column</td>\n<td><code>ICU</code> provider + <code>und-x-icu</code>（Unicode 默认）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MySQL 8.0+</td>\n<td>Server → Database → Table → Column</td>\n<td><code>utf8mb4_unicode_ci</code>（accent/case insensitive）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SQL Server</td>\n<td>Server → Database → Column</td>\n<td><code>Latin1_General_100_CI_AS_SC_UTF8</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>PostgreSQL 15 引入的 ICU collation provider 支持按需为特定列指定 locale：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 全局使用 Unicode 默认排序&#10;CREATE DATABASE app WITH LOCALE_PROVIDER = icu ICU_LOCALE = &#39;und&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 特定列使用瑞典语排序&#10;CREATE TABLE products (&#10;  id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  name_sv TEXT COLLATE &quot;sv-x-icu&quot;&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 查询时动态指定 collation&#10;SELECT * FROM products ORDER BY name COLLATE &quot;ja-x-icu&quot;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 全局使用 Unicode 默认排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATABASE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LOCALE_PROVIDER </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> icu ICU_LOCALE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'und'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 特定列使用瑞典语排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> products</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name_sv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> COLLATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"sv-x-icu\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询时动态指定 collation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> COLLATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ja-x-icu\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>CI vs CS</strong>（Case Insensitive vs Case Sensitive）：大多数用户搜索期望 case insensitive，但某些场景（如 API key、密码哈希对比）必须 case sensitive。推荐：默认列用 CI，需要精确比较时在查询中显式指定 CS collation。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排序键-sort-key-与预计算\">排序键（Sort Key）与预计算</h2><p>对于高频排序查询，每次比较都调用 UCA 的多级权重计算成本太高。<strong>排序键</strong>预计算解决这个问题——将字符串转换为可直接字节比较的二进制键：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Original: &#39;München&#39;&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;ICU Collator&lt;br/&gt;locale=de&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Sort Key: 0x4D..6E..01..0A..&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;memcmp() for comparison&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Original: 'München'\"] --&gt; B[\"ICU Collator&lt;br/&gt;locale=de\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Sort Key: 0x4D..6E..01..0A..\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"memcmp() for comparison\"]</pre><p>排序键的特性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成后可用 <code>memcmp()</code> 直接比较（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），无需重新调用 collation 逻辑</li>\n<li>同一 locale 下生成的排序键，字节序等价于 UCA 排序结果</li>\n<li>代价：额外存储空间（排序键通常比原字符串长 1.5-3 倍）</li>\n<li>排序键不可逆——不能从排序键还原原始字符串</li>\n</ul>\n<p>适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>是否适合排序键</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>百万级记录 ORDER BY</td>\n<td>适合</td>\n<td>预计算 amortize 比较成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时用户输入匹配</td>\n<td>不适合</td>\n<td>每次输入变化要重新生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多 locale 排序</td>\n<td>看情况</td>\n<td>每个 locale 需独立排序键列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分页场景的游标</td>\n<td>适合</td>\n<td>游标可用排序键实现精确定位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多语言全文搜索\">多语言全文搜索</h2><p>全文搜索引擎对多语言文本的处理涉及多个 i18n 难题：</p>\n<p><strong>分词（Tokenization）</strong>：英语用空格分词，但中/日/韩文没有词间空格。日语混合使用汉字、平假名、片假名和拉丁字符，需要形态素分析器（如 MeCab/kuromoji）。</p>\n<p><strong>词干提取（Stemming）</strong>：英语 <code>running → run</code>，但阿拉伯语的词根系统（三辅音词根）需要完全不同的算法。并非所有语言都适合 stemming——中文/日文通常不做。</p>\n<p><strong>同义词与停用词</strong>：每种语言有独立的停用词列表和同义词映射。法语的 <code>le/la/les</code> 是停用词，但西班牙语的 <code>el/la/los</code> 可能不是（取决于搜索场景）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>搜索引擎</th>\n<th>多语言支持</th>\n<th>CJK 分词</th>\n<th>Locale-aware ranking</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Elasticsearch</td>\n<td>per-field analyzer</td>\n<td>kuromoji/ik/smartcn</td>\n<td>是，需配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PostgreSQL FTS</td>\n<td>per-column config</td>\n<td>zhparser/mecab</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meilisearch</td>\n<td>自动语言检测</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Typesense</td>\n<td>per-field locale</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Elasticsearch 的多语言索引策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;mappings&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;title_en&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;text&quot;,&#10;        &quot;analyzer&quot;: &quot;english&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;title_ja&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;text&quot;,&#10;        &quot;analyzer&quot;: &quot;kuromoji&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;title_all&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;text&quot;,&#10;        &quot;analyzer&quot;: &quot;icu_analyzer&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mappings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"title_en\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"analyzer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"english\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"title_ja\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"analyzer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kuromoji\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"title_all\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"analyzer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"icu_analyzer\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两种常见架构：<strong>per-locale 字段</strong>（<code>title_en</code>, <code>title_ja</code>）提供最精确的分析但 schema 随语言增长；<strong>统一字段 + ICU analyzer</strong> 更简单但对某些语言分词精度降低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"音译与模糊搜索\">音译与模糊搜索</h2><p>用户可能用罗马化输入搜索非拉丁文内容（如输入 &quot;tokyo&quot; 搜索 &quot;東京&quot;，输入 &quot;putin&quot; 搜索 &quot;普京&quot;）。后端需要维护音译索引：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>日语</strong>：汉字 → 平假名/片假名 → 罗马字（需 MeCab 读音数据）</li>\n<li><strong>中文</strong>：汉字 → 拼音（注意多音字：<code>长</code> = cháng / zhǎng）</li>\n<li><strong>韩文</strong>：谚文 → 罗马化（Revised Romanization）</li>\n<li><strong>阿拉伯语</strong>：阿拉伯字母 → 拉丁转写</li>\n</ul>\n<p>ICU 的 <code>Transliterator</code> 提供标准化的转写规则。ICU4X 2.2 的 <code>icu_experimental</code> 中包含部分转写支持，完整稳定 API 预计在后续版本。</p>\n<p>模糊搜索的 locale 感知编辑距离也需要考虑：在德语中 <code>ue</code> 和 <code>ü</code> 的编辑距离应该小于在英语中——因为德语键盘可能打出 <code>ue</code> 作为 <code>ü</code> 的替代。这类 locale-aware 模糊匹配通常需要自定义评分函数。与搜索性能相关的缓存策略见<a href=\"../operations/i18n-performance-caching\">国际化性能与缓存</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多语言排序与搜索的核心认知：字节序不是排序，locale collation 才是。UCA 的多级权重系统加上 CLDR tailoring 数据提供了语言学正确的排序基础；数据库的 ICU collation provider 让 ORDER BY 自动遵循 locale 规则。排序键预计算 amortize 高频排序场景的性能成本。全文搜索需要 per-locale 分析器链（分词→词干→同义词），音译索引则让用户能跨文字系统搜索。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"排序规则与搜索","id":"排序规则与搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Unicode Collation Algorithm (UCA)","id":"unicode-collation-algorithm-uca"},{"level":2,"text":"Locale 特定的排序差异","id":"locale-特定的排序差异"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库 Collation 配置","id":"数据库-collation-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"排序键（Sort Key）与预计算","id":"排序键-sort-key-与预计算"},{"level":2,"text":"多语言全文搜索","id":"多语言全文搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"音译与模糊搜索","id":"音译与模糊搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"货币与数字格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling/currency-number-formatting"},"next":{"title":"翻译管理系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/translation-management-systems"}}